sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant MTA as MTA
    participant L as LMTP session
    participant AU as Auth cache / Nauthilus
    participant S as Sieve
    participant R as registry "mailboxes"
    participant D as data pool msg/GUID/N
    participant F as ftsmap + ftx objects
    participant AC as account
    participant MB as mbox/ID
    participant W as watchers
    MTA->>L: RCPT TO alice@example.org
    L->>AU: who is this recipient?
    AU-->>L: canonical account
    MTA->>L: DATA (the message)
    L->>S: run the active script (object "sieve")
    S-->>L: keep in INBOX, or fileinto
    L->>R: CAS: reserve quota, add intent bi:GUID
    L->>D: write the chunks, refs = 1
    L->>F: CAS id map, CAS posting objects, dictionary keys
    L->>AC: CAS: announce p:SEQ
    L->>MB: CAS: new UID, MODSEQ, entry m:UID
    L->>AC: record a:SEQ, drop p:SEQ
    L->>R: remove bi:GUID (batched)
    L-)W: notify mbox/ID and account
    L-->>MTA: 250 for this recipient
    Note over AC,W: IDLE and NOTIFY sessions and JMAP push workers wake up and read
